	(text "12 MHz DOT CLOCK, CHARACTER COUNTER, CODE LATCH, CHARACTER ROM, SHIFTER" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ae8b360c-befa-505a-ad08-ec8051e388a9"))
	(text "IC15 counts 8-15 (8 dots): QC clocks the 6845, CHARCLOCK = NOT RCO loads the shifter and the latches. The code\nlatch IC11 takes 7 bits of the IDT's left port: 28C64 A3-A9, A0-A2 = RA0-RA2. IC14 delays reverse/cursor (IC22A)\nand DE by two characters. For GFX: QCR = QC OR RCO (IC20B), WEPH = QA XOR QB (IC22D)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4f1a3bad-2cdd-5445-9ae0-753b5b0b3273"))
